{"product_id":"frozen-charlotte","title":"Frozen Charlotte","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe're waiting for you to come and play. Dunvegan School for Girls has been closed for many years. Converted into a family home, the teachers and students are long gone. But they left something behind...Sophie arrives at the old schoolhouse to spend the summer with her cousins. Brooding Cameron with his scarred hand, strange Lilias with a fear of bones and Piper, who seems just a bit too good to be true. And then there's her other cousin. The girl with a room full of antique dolls. The girl that shouldn't be there. The girl that died.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 132 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Alex Bell\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781847154538\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 342\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45169635491993,"sku":"3RE9781847154538","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67b9a786c0f09_Frozen_20Charlotte_20Alex_20Bell.jpg?v=1740232383","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/frozen-charlotte","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}